#: ../../concepts/lfs.md:1
msgid "Large File Server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/lfs.md:3
msgid ""
"PySME does not come with all of the large atmosphere or NLTE grids as "
"part of the distribution. Instead Uppsala University provides a server "
"that serves the files when needed. Simply specify one of the available "
"filenames and PySME will fetch the file on your next run."
msgstr ""

